The main difference is that when you're stunned, your pet is still safe--you  
will stop to avoid hitting them.  When you're confused, though, you may  
accidentally hit your pet if the direction you end up moving happens to be  
towards the pet...

And, reading scrolls while you're confused has different effects, while  
stunning doesn't affect them.
